
>> winkel := (List nĳ
	set: ['tydskrift'] by: ['books'],
	set: ['kompjûter'] by: ['elektroanika'],
	set: ['lippestift'] by: ['kosmetika']
).
Utfier skriuwe: (winkel hat: ['kompjûter']), nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (winkel hat: ['woarst']), nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (winkel hat: ['kompjûters']), nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (winkel hat: ['kompjût']), nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (winkel hat: ['2kompjûter']), nije-rigel. 
